<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    background: {{ section.settings.background }};
    padding: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px 24px {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder {
    max-width: {{ section.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #111111;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__heading {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 7vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.05;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__intro {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__quote {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid #038bdd;
    color: #038bdd;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__body-panel {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__body {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__signoff {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 72px 0 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid #cccccc;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__image-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    top: -48px;
    right: 0;
    width: 160px;
    max-width: 42%;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 10px;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__signature {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding-right: 45%;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .learn-founder__signature-rule {
    margin: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #cccccc;
  }
</style>

<section class="learn-founder" id="learn-founder-story" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
    <h2 class="learn-founder__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
    <div class="learn-founder__intro rte">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if section.settings.quote != blank -%}
    <blockquote class="learn-founder__quote">{{ section.settings.quote | escape }}</blockquote>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if section.settings.body != blank -%}
    <div class="learn-founder__body-panel">
      <div class="learn-founder__body rte">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if section.settings.signature != blank or section.settings.image != blank -%}
    <div class="learn-founder__signoff">
      {%- if section.settings.image != blank -%}
        <div class="learn-founder__image-wrap">
          {{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: class: 'learn-founder__image', loading: 'lazy', widths: '180,360,400', sizes: '(min-width: 520px) 180px, 42vw' }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.signature != blank -%}
        <p class="learn-founder__signature">{{ section.settings.signature | escape }}</p>
        <hr class="learn-founder__signature-rule" aria-hidden="true">
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Learn founder story",
  "class": "shopify-section--learn-founder-story",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "HOW BRISA STARTED."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro",
      "default": "<p>I was at work trying to talk the boys off the vapes. I've always hated them. Watching mates I care about smoke chemicals nobody can pronounce never sat right with me.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "quote",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "It's not the nicotine, mate. It's the hand-to-mouth. Every time I try to stop, that's what pulls me back."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "<p>That stuck. I went home, did the research, called Kaiden. We bought every product we could find, tested them all, and knew what was missing and what to produce.</p><p>They all missed the same things. Felt cheap in your hand. Looked out of place pulling out at the pub or on a worksite, or replaced bad stuff with more bad stuff. Nothing anyone actually wanted.</p><p>So we built our own option. Same motion. Same draw. Same moment. No chemicals, no nicotine, no vapour. Built solid. Looks the part. Flavours people actually know, with every aspect in mind.</p><p>Something Aussies are happy to be seen with.</p><p>That's Brisa. Still the two of us behind it.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Founders image"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "signature",
      "label": "Signature",
      "default": "— SAM & KAIDEN, CO-FOUNDERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_width",
      "label": "Max width",
      "min": 360,
      "max": 800,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 520
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 40
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Learn founder story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
